<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41705" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Rhoetus</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Rhoecus</span></b> ), i, m.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A giant</i>, <i><span class="en">Hor. C. 2,
				19, 23</span></i>; <i><span class="en">3, 4, 55</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A centaur</i>, <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
				12, 271 sq.</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Verg. G. 2, 456</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">id. Cul. 27</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Val. Fl. 1,
				140</span></i>.—Form Rhoecus, <i><span class="en">Luc. 6,
			390</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>III.</b>
			<i>A companion of Phineus</i>, <i><span class="en">Ov. M. 5,
			38</span></i>. — </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>A king of the Marsians</i>, <i><span class="en">Verg. A.
				10, 388</span></i> Serv.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
